    "description": "Once per encounter as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, you can attempt to seize a held, carried, or worn object from an adjacent target by making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarm\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a> attack, with a +10 bonus on your attack roll.<br><br>If the attack succeeds, you are now holding the object, and you cannot use this Talent in place of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarm\" title=\"Disarm\">Disarm</a> Action. You cannot conceal the use of this Talent from the target.",
